### Send create user event
POST http://localhost:3000/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "event": "create_user",
    "data": {
        "name": "Alice Johnson",
        "email": "alice@example.com",
        "role": "user"
    }
}

### Send status update event
POST http://localhost:3000/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "event": "update_status",
    "data": {
        "userId": 2,
        "status": "inactive",
        "lastLogin": "2025-02-09T12:00:00Z"
    }
}

### Get all stored data
GET http://localhost:3000/data